            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Emily Schreiber Moe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and tasty! I needed a recipe to use up some canned peach pieces and came across this one. I am an intermediate baker and found this recipe to be easy to follow and the end result was great. I omitted the nuts since we didn't have them on hand. We also didn't have coarse sugar -w hich the entire family agreed would have been better than plain old granulated sugar we used on top. We put butter and honey on them and everyone had seconds. I can see us playing around with the add ins - I'd love to try with raspberries or blueberries. This recipe will go into the recipe box!"
          },
