              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "misheclark"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The dough came out way too wet, more like a muffin batter. Maybe it was my fault for using fresh peaches, but I needed to add almost 1 cup of additional flour to get this dough to come together so that I could pat it out and slice it. They taste fine, but not peachy enough for me. The texture is more like a muffin than a scone.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-12T20:11:11.133Z"
          },
          {
