            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kay W"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made these many times because in Ontario it’s peach season. I changed it a bit. \n\nI use 4 peaches. It makes just over a cup of peaches. I add a tbsp of vanilla and cinnamon. The original recipe lacked a bit of flavour for me but when I changed it like this it was delicious and very peachy! I also eliminated the pecans.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-05T12:46:48.920Z"
